            <span id="alg1.l12.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> return </span><math id="alg1.l12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M^{\prime}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">M</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">′</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M^{\prime}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l12.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">, the MoE SLM model after modality expert partitioning and training.
</span>
</div>
