<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Experimental Setup Details</h2>

<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A2.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ Appendix B Experimental Setup Details ‣ DeepTalk: Towards Seamless and Smart Speech Interaction with Adaptive Modality-Specific MoE" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> outlines the main hyperparameters used during each stage of training. All ablation studies were conducted using a total batch size of 128, with learning rates of 1e-4, 2e-5, and 5e-5.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.T6" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 6: </span>Hyperparameters used in each stage training on DeepTalk.</figcaption>
<table id="A2.T6.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A2.T6.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A2.T6.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_th_row ltx_border_r ltx_border_tt">Hyperparameter</th>
<th id="A2.T6.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_r ltx_border_tt">Stage 1</th>
<th id="A2.T6.2.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_r ltx_border_tt">Stage 2.1</th>
<th id="A2.T6.2.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_r ltx_border_tt">Stage 2.2</th>
<th id="A2.T6.2.1.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_r ltx_border_tt">Stage 3</th>
<th id="A2.T6.2.1.6" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">Stage RL</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A2.T6.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A2.T6.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_r ltx_border_tt">Learning rate</th>
